      "id": "claim_405522f7116141529782fa78114da57a",
      "statement": "frontend/src/lib/api-client.ts is the single integration point wrapping the generated OpenAPI client: it builds one shared Configuration with basePath API_BASE_URL ('/api/backend') and an authMiddleware that attaches a bearer access token (via getValidAccessToken from lib/keycloak.ts) to every request, then exports singleton *Api instances and thin async wrapper functions used throughout the app.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/src/lib/api-client.ts#L1-L76",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3dc9f840f9652960b40cd7fb0019d7f29b0d42492b9294f4473ced6a9f5a1751:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_8828a6fd5ea1471780d6517b6af0da78",
      "statement": "The frontend never calls the FastAPI backend origin directly from the browser: next.config.ts rewrites '/api/backend/:path*' to the backend's NEXT_API_URL (default http://localhost:8000), and lib/constants.ts centralizes that '/api/backend' prefix via API_BASE_URL/backendUrl().",
