      "id": "claim_6c0d1d91b56b450a8a68249a0432cb92",
      "statement": "useAutosave is a generic debounced-autosave hook: it debounces save() calls by a configurable delay, tracks an idle/pending/saving/saved status, re-runs the save if the value changed again while a save was in flight, and flushes any unsaved change on unmount so navigating away does not lose in-progress editor content.",
