      "statement": "app/auth/callback/page.tsx is the PKCE authorization-code redirect target: it exchanges the returned code plus stashed PKCE verifier for tokens via exchangeCodeForTokens, persists them with storeTokens (which dispatches the 'kc:login' event consumed by useAuth), fires a best-effort POST /api/v1/auth/sync to sync the user's role into the backend database, and redirects to '/', rendering an inline error card instead on failure.",
